ACESS MODIFIERS
1)Private(default) =data & method accessible inside class
2)Public: Dta and method accessible to everyone
3)Protected:data and method accessible inside class and  to its derived class

ENCAPSULATION
it is wrapping up of data and members function in a single unit called class    .

iska matlba ye hai k apne kuch data lio or kuch member function lia or in sab ko jor k apne aik capsule bna di yani class
